<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-HK">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>太陽能光伏系統定期巡檢報告</title>
    <style>
        /* 網頁基本樣式 */
        body {
            font-family: "Microsoft JhengHei", "PingFang TC", Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f9;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        /* 控制按鈕區 */
        .no-print {
            text-align: right;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .btn-print {
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 24px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-print:hover {
            background-color: #0056b3;
        }

        /* Header 圖片背景區域 */
        .header-bg {
            width: 100%;
            height: 180px;
            background: url('https://googleusercontent.com/image_generation_content/317') no-repeat center top;
            background-size: cover;
            border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* 標題與表單 */
        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #1a2a3a;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        .form-section {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .form-section-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #0056b3;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #0056b3;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .grid-2 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .form-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        label {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        input[type="text"], input[type="date"], textarea, select {
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 14px;
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        textarea {
            resize: vertical;
            height: 80px;
        }

        /* 表格樣式 */
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #dddddd;
            text-align: left;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }

        /* --------------------------------------------------
           列印專用 CSS（隱藏按鈕、優化輸入框顯示）
        -------------------------------------------------- */
        @media print {
            body {
                background-color: #fff;
                padding: 0;
            }

            .container {
                box-shadow: none;
                padding: 0;
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 100%;
            }

            .no-print {
                display: none !important; /* 列印時隱藏 Print 按鈕 */
            }

            /* 將 Input 與 Textarea 邊框去除，顯示如一般文字 */
            input[type="text"], input[type="date"], textarea, select {
                border: none;
                background: transparent;
                padding: 0;
                font-size: 14px;
                appearance: none;
                -webkit-appearance: none;
            }

            .header-bg {
                -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
                print-color-adjust: exact;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="no-print">
        <button class="btn-print" onclick="window.print()">🖨️ 列印 / 儲存為 PDF</button>
    </div>

    <div class="header-bg"></div>

    <h1>太陽能光伏系統定期巡檢報告</h1>

    <form id="inspectionReport">
        <div class="form-section">
            <div class="form-section-title">一、 基本資料</div>
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>客戶名稱 / 項目名稱：</label>
                    <input type="text" placeholder="請輸入名稱">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>巡檢日期：</label>
                    <input type="date">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>案場地址：</label>
                    <input type="text" placeholder="請輸入地址">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>巡檢人員：</label>
                    <input type="text" placeholder="請輸入巡檢人員姓名">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section">
            <div class="form-section-title">二、 巡檢與測試項目</div>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th style="width: 30%;">檢查項目</th>
                        <th style="width: 25%;">檢查結果</th>
                        <th>備註 / 異常說明</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>1. 光伏板表面（清潔/破損）</td>
                        <td>
                            <select>
                                <option>正常</option>
                                <option>需清潔</option>
                                <option>異常/破損</option>
                            </select>
                        </td>
                        <td><input type="text" placeholder="備註"></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>2. 支架結構與螺絲鬆緊</td>
                        <td>
                            <select>
                                <option>正常</option>
                                <option>需緊固</option>
                                <option>異常/鏽蝕</option>
                            </select>
                        </td>
                        <td><input type="text" placeholder="備註"></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>3. 逆變器（Inverter）運作狀態</td>
                        <td>
                            <select>
                                <option>正常運作</option>
                                <option>警告/告警</option>
                                <option>停機異常</option>
                            </select>
                        </td>
                        <td><input type="text" placeholder="備註"></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>4. 配電箱及線路連接</td>
                        <td>
                            <select>
                                <option>正常</option>
                                <option>線路鬆脫</option>
                                <option>異常</option>
                            </select>
                        </td>
                        <td><input type="text" placeholder="備註"></td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="form-section">
            <div class="form-section-title">三、 巡檢總結及處理建議</div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <textarea placeholder="請在此輸入總結評估或後續跟進建議..."></textarea>
            </div>
        </div>
    </form>
</div>

</body>
</html>
